  // The fauna of caves, tunnels and places (POIs). Each role is a job in a place's small
  // ecosystem; its body is rolled from the forms listed, by the same part and proportion rules
  // as the surface's, then themed by the place: pale and blind deep down, armoured and rust-dark
  // in industrial wrecks, glossy and glowing in alien places. Every ambush has a tell (TellKind)
  // that runs at least tellSeconds before the strike begins, and the strike is then the
  // signature attack with its own telegraphed wind-up: frightening, but fair. "notice" is how
  // close a player walking upright gets before a creature notices them (crouching shrinks it):
  // until then the place's hunters go after its subsisters, a food chain you can watch.
